{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "What happened to you?", "hi": "आपको क्या हुआ?", "r": "Tuhanu ki hoya?", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਕੀ ਹੋਇਆ?"}, {"en": "Doctor, fever for two days.", "hi": "डॉक्टर, दो दिन से बुख़ार है।", "r": "Daktar sahib, do dina to bukhar hai.", "sp": "Patient", "t": "ਡਾਕਟਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ, ਦੋ ਦਿਨਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਬੁਖਾਰ ਹੈ।"}, {"en": "Any cough or cold?", "hi": "खाँसी-ज़ुकाम है?", "r": "Khangh-zukam hai?", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "ਖੰਘ-ਜ਼ੁਕਾਮ ਹੈ?"}, {"en": "Only a cough.", "hi": "सिर्फ़ ख़ाँसी है।", "r": "Sirf khangh hai.", "sp": "Patient", "t": "ਸਿਰਫ਼ ਖੰਘ ਹੈ।"}, {"en": "Don't fear. Take this tablet.", "hi": "घबराइए मत। यह गोली लीजिए।", "r": "Daro na. Eh goli lao.", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "ਡਰੋ ਨਾ। ਇਹ ਗੋਲੀ ਲਓ।"}, {"en": "Thanks doctor. Any diet restrictions?", "hi": "शुक्रिया डॉक्टर। कोई परहेज़?", "r": "Shukriya daktar sahib. Koi parhez?", "sp": "Patient", "t": "ਸ਼ੁਕਰੀਆ ਡਾਕਟਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ। ਕੋਈ ਪਰਹੇਜ਼?"}], "title": "At the clinic"}, "lede": "Body, symptoms and the clinic — Punjabi for staying well.", "phrases": [{"en": "I am not feeling well", "hi": "मेरी तबीयत ठीक नहीं है", "r": "Mainu changa nahi lag riha", "t": "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਚੰਗਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਲੱਗ ਰਿਹਾ"}, {"en": "I have a fever", "hi": "मुझे बुख़ार है", "r": "Mainu bukhar hai", "t": "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਬੁਖਾਰ ਹੈ"}, {"en": "My head aches", "hi": "मेरे सिर में दर्द है", "r": "Sir dukhda hai", "t": "ਸਿਰ ਦੁਖਦਾ ਹੈ"}, {"en": "Call a doctor", "hi": "डॉक्टर को बुलाओ", "r": "Daktar nu bulao", "t": "ਡਾਕਟਰ ਨੂੰ ਬੁਲਾਓ"}, {"en": "Take me to hospital", "hi": "मुझे अस्पताल ले चलो", "r": "Mainu sarkari haspatal lai jao", "t": "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਸਰਕਾਰੀ ਹਸਪਤਾਲ ਲੈ ਜਾਓ"}, {"en": "Where is the pharmacy?", "hi": "दवाख़ाना कहाँ है?", "r": "Davai di dukan kitthe hai?", "t": "ਦਵਾਈ ਦੀ ਦੁਕਾਨ ਕਿੱਥੇ ਹੈ?"}, {"en": "Take this medicine", "hi": "यह दवा लो", "r": "Eh davai lao", "t": "ਇਹ ਦਵਾਈ ਲਓ"}, {"en": "Drink hot water", "hi": "गरम पानी पियो", "r": "Garam pani pio", "t": "ਗਰਮ ਪਾਣੀ ਪੀਓ"}, {"en": "Take rest", "hi": "आराम करो", "r": "Aaram karo", "t": "ਆਰਾਮ ਕਰੋ"}, {"en": "Get well soon", "hi": "जल्दी ठी